    "text": "syvnews.com\nwebsite\nBuellton\nBuellton planners push to reclaim Avenue of Flags with motel conversion ordinance\nBy Lisa André landre@syvnews.com,\n4 hours agoIn a decisive 3-0 vote, the Buellton Planning Commission advanced a draft ordinance to the City Council, mandating that motel properties along Avenue of Flags, long used as residential rentals, revert to short-term motel use by Dec. 31. The move, designed to revitalize Buellton’s commercial corridor, sparked detailed discussions on...\n1",
